      "is": "IS 5246:2000",
      "clause": "7",
      "title": "End Coating",
      "text": "7. End Coating  —  Shall be adequately coated, up to a distance of at least 125 mm, with any of the materials mentioned in IS 1141 : 1993*.  Application of  end coating on the logs shall be done soon after the inspection of the log. *Code of practice for seasoning of timber (second revision). SUMMARY OF IS  5246 : 2000   CONIFEROUS LOGS (First revision) For detailed Information, refer to IS  5246  : 2000  Specification for coniferous logs first revision",
